Date: Tue, 6 Feb 2024 09:45:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1138/1695] drivers: stm32_rtc: remove includes and reorder
 macros definition
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Reorder the register macros with the order we found in the
documentation of RTC register.
Add documentation header for the macros.
Remove unused header files inclusion.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git ac406cb6e132bf5c66510c2654276865e6d5e2e4 drivers: stm32_rtc: remove includes and reorder macros definition]
Change-Id: Ie4073910247a0eb6261d1cd2553bd1f7f7fa29cc
Signed-off-by: Clément Le Goffic <clement.legoffic@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/402351
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/drivers/stm32_rtc.c | 70 +++++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 1 file changed, 36 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/drivers/stm32_rtc.c b/core/drivers/stm32_rtc.c
index 852931292..1067c4ae2 100644
--- a/core/drivers/stm32_rtc.c
+++ b/core/drivers/stm32_rtc.c
@@ -8,21 +8,19 @@
